sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HQ as Authorized dispatcher
    actor R as Assigned rescuer
    participant API as Dispatch and field APIs
    participant DB as Assignment, household and report records
    participant Router as Routing service
    HQ->>API: Review area priorities and available teams
    API->>DB: Read affected households, criteria and responder availability
    HQ->>API: Confirm assignment and selected responders
    API->>DB: Save scoped assignment and history
    R->>API: Load own assignment and destination
    API->>Router: Calculate permitted road route
    Router-->>R: Route geometry and directions through app
    R->>API: Accept, mark en route, then mark arrived
    API->>DB: Save progression, location and timestamps
    R->>API: Check in and submit each household member assessment
    API->>DB: Save member outcomes and field report
    opt Communication required and internet available
        R->>API: Start PTT session, upload voice clip/signals
        API->>DB: Record communication metadata
        API-->>HQ: Authorized communication feed
    end
    R->>API: Submit eligible final household/assignment outcome
    API->>DB: Validate transition and persist result
    API-->>HQ: Updated operational picture
